{
 "schemaVersion": 1,
 "kind": "vfx-semantic-rules",
 "note": "AI 標註輸入。每條規則都必須列出實際看過的代表圖（evidence）。propagation 決定語意能傳播多遠：evidenceOnly=只給看過的；group=再加上像素簽章證實同形的載體變體；family=同家族其他成員（信心降為 medium）。",
 "libraryId": "effects-materials",
 "rules": [
  {
   "ruleId": "any/pack-preview",
   "select": {
    "namePattern": "^(preview|sample|overview)$",
    "maxDepth": 1,
    "format": "png"
   },
   "evidence": [],
   "propagation": "family",
   "semantics": {
    "kind": "preview"
   },
   "observation": "套件宣傳圖／總覽圖，位於 package 根目錄。依位置＋命名判定，非看圖判定，故信心為 medium"
  },
  {
   "ruleId": "any/vector-source",
   "select": {
    "format": "svg"
   },
   "evidence": [],
   "propagation": "family",
   "semantics": {
    "kind": "nonVfx"
   },
   "observation": "向量原稿，runtime 不能直接使用（需先點陣化），且沒有像素可供判讀形狀；標為 nonVfx 以免被選成貼圖"
  },
  {
   "ruleId": "foliage/sprite",
   "select": {
    "package": "foliage-sprites",
    "namePattern": "^sprite_\\d+$",
    "format": "png"
   },
   "evidence": [
    "foliage-sprites/png/flat/sprite_0001.png"
   ],
   "propagation": "family",
   "semantics": {
    "kind": "nonVfx"
   },
   "observation": "植物剪影，非特效素材；納入索引只為了讓搜尋能明確排除"
  },
  {
   "ruleId": "lightmask/circle",
   "select": {
    "package": "light-masks-1.0",
    "namePattern": "^circle_[a-z](_(noise|streaks|streaks_noise))?$",
    "format": "png"
   },
   "evidence": [
    "light-masks-1.0/default/circle_a_noise.png",
    "light-masks-1.0/default/circle_b.png"
   ],
   "propagation": "family",
   "semantics": {
    "kind": "vfx",
    "shape": "disc",
    "usage": [
     "glow",
     "mask"
    ],
    "element": "neutral",
    "tags": [
     "soft",
     "radial"
    ]
   }
  },
  {
   "ruleId": "lightmask/circle_rings",
   "select": {
    "package": "light-masks-1.0",
